    "concept_4": {
      "id": "concept_4",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "That identity creates telescoping sums.\n\n1/(√2+1) + 1/(√3+√2) + 1/(2+√3)\nbecomes\n(√2−1)+(√3−√2)+(2−√3).\n\nEverything in the middle cancels, leaving 1.",
